{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/c144e7f44efb0aefde4e7710cb5d41e9.jpeg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8em; font-family: Poppins; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">From the very beginning in the early 1990s, our founders who were involved in the home development industry discovered that the kitchen and bathroom areas of a house were the essential areas that provided high resale returns. They focused on seeking ways to improve the kitchen and bath areas of the home that would increase the value of the home. Therefore, they targeted on those products that would generate large returns without extensively revamping the kitchen and bath areas. They found that by just adding distinctive kitchen lights, impactful sink, unique faucet or range hood, this resulted in home huge value increases.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8em; font-family: Poppins; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">Therefore, Farmhouse Kitchen and Bath was founded for the sole purpose of bringing specific products that would add tremendous value to the kitchen and bath without having to spend thousands of dollars in renovations. They wanted to showcase many products and decided to introduce an online store in order to achieve this. Their goal was to provide a way online shoppers could purchase with confidence products at the lowest price, buying direct to avoid the middleman, products with solid warranties and with the objective of ultimately adding tremendous value to their kitchen and bath. Also creating a big box store experience but with much more choices in products for the kitchen and bath.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8em; font-family: Poppins; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp;you have not ordered from Farmhousekitchenandbath.com and you have questions regarding our products, you can call our (800)604-1380 toll-free and speak to one of our Sales Team representatives. If you have ordered and have an after sale order inquiry, please message&nbsp;</span><a style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; outline: 0px; transition: color 0.1s linear 0s; touch-action: manipulation; background-position: 0px 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit;\">customerservice@farmhousekitchenandbath.com</span></a><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp;and one of our dedicated online after-sale customer service team members will reply back to you. Feel confident that we check our inbox regularly.</span></p></div>",
